q01.

The `CreateMemo` RPC maps to `POST /api/v1/memos` in the REST gateway, as defined by the `google.api.http` option on the RPC.

```21:27:proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto
  rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
    option (google.api.http) = {
      post: "/api/v1/memos"
      body: "memo"
    };
    option (google.api.method_signature) = "memo";
  }
```

Answer: `POST /api/v1/memos`
